全</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Go</category><category>Map</category><category>数据类型</category><category>Golang</category></item><item><title>Go 内存管理——栈、堆与逃逸分析</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/golang/2026-06-25-go-%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-%E6%A0%88%E5%A0%86%E9%80%83%E9%80%B8%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/</link><pubDate>Thu, 25 Jun 2026 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Thu, 25 Jun 2026 02:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/golang/2026-06-25-go-%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-%E6%A0%88%E5%A0%86%E9%80%83%E9%80%B8%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/</guid><description>重要 Go 的内存分配由编译器逃逸分析决定：不逃逸 → 栈上分配（函数返回即释放），逃逸 → 堆上分配（GC 回收）。make 和 new 只是分配方式的不同，本质区</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Go</category><category>内存管理</category><category>逃逸分析</category><category>Golang</category></item><item><title>Go GMP 调度模型详解</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/golang/2026-06-25-go-gmp-%E8%B0%83%E5%BA%A6%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/</link><pubDate>Thu, 25 Jun 2026 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Thu, 25 Jun 2026 01:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/golang/2026-06-25-go-gmp-%E8%B0%83%E5%BA%A6%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/</guid><description>重要 GMP 是 Go 的调度器模型：G（Goroutine）是执行体，M（Machine）是 OS 线程，P（Processor）是 M 的运行上下文。调度器通过</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Go</category><category>GMP</category><category>调度器</category><category>并发</category><category>Golang</category></item><item><title>Go GC 原理详解——三色标记与混合写屏障</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/golang/2026-06-25-go-gc-%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3/</link><pubDate>Thu, 25 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Thu, 25 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/golang/2026-06-25-go-gc-%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3/</guid><description>重要 Go 1.8+ GC 使用并发三色标记 + 混合写屏障，STW 降至微秒级。核心设计取舍：编译器逃逸分析将短生命周期对象留在栈上使分代回收收益小；TCMall</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Go</category><category>GC</category><category>三色标记</category><category>写屏障</category><category>Golang</category></item><item><title>K8s设备插件-编写自定义DevicePlugin</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2024-07-10-k8s%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6-%E7%BC%96%E5%86%99%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89deviceplugin/</link><pubDate>Wed, 10 Jul 2024 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Wed, 10 Jul 2024 22:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2024-07-10-k8s%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6-%E7%BC%96%E5%86%99%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89deviceplugin/</guid><description>系列导航 本系列介绍 K8s 中 Device Plugin 机制及其在 GPU 管理等 AI 场景中的应用。 ① GPU基础 → ② Device Plugin → ③ 开发Plugin → ④ 多设备/AI场景 → ⑤ DRA 顺序 文章 定位 ①</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Device Plugin</category><category>Go</category><category>FPGA</category><category>RDMA</category><category>Kubernetes</category><category>k8s设备插件</category></item><item><title>Go 面试速记-八股文</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/interview/2024-04-18-go-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%80%9F%E8%AE%B0-%E5%85%AB%E8%82%A1%E6%96%87/</link><pubDate>Mon, 15 Apr 2024 19:10:41 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Mon, 15 Apr 2024 19:10:41 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/interview/2024-04-18-go-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%80%9F%E8%AE%B0-%E5%85%AB%E8%82%A1%E6%96%87/</guid><description>1. GMP 调度模型 组件 角色 G（Goroutine） 执行体，每个 goroutine 对应一个 G M（Machine） OS 线程，G 必须绑定到 M 才能执行 P（Processor</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Go</category><category>面试速记</category><category>面试</category></item><item><title>K8s存储-CSI插件开发指南</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2024-03-01-k8s%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8-csi%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</link><pubDate>Fri, 01 Mar 2024 22:0